    "state": "present",
    "source": "retro.json",
    "author": "implementer",
    "independent": false,
    "summary": "本轮修复唯一已观察到的失败：Migration 中集合构建器把索引选项对象误当作字段参数传给 index()。",
    "blockers": [
      {
        "id": "notes/run/37453047768/attempt/1/B1",
        "phase": "repair",
        "title": "create_project_materials 迁移类型检查失败 (TS2353)",
        "symptom": "tsconfig.server.json 下 tsc 报 database/main/migrations/202609200001_create_project_materials.ts(38,18): error TS2353: Object literal may only specify known properties, and 'name' does not exist in type 'string[]'。",
        "rootCause": "在项目资料集合上写成 collection.foreignKey('ownerId', {...}).index({ name: 'idx_project_materials_owner' })。foreignKey 返回的是 CollectionDefinitionBuilder，其 index 签名为 index(fields: string | string[], options?)，因此以选项对象作为第一个实参会被当作 fields: string[] 校验，对象字面量因只有未知属性 name 而报 TS2353。",
        "resolution": "拆成两个独立调用：collection.foreignKey('ownerId', {...}) 定义外键，collection.index('ownerId', { name: 'idx_project_materials_owner' }) 单独声明命名索引，符合 Builder 的 index(fields, options) 契约。",
        "cost": null,
        "status": "resolved"
      }
    ],
    "improvements": [
      {
        "id": "notes/run/37453047768/attempt/1/I1",
        "category": "skills-docs",
        "title": "Builder 链式调用的字段/选项区分",
        "detail": "nocobase-db Skill 的 Builder 章节给出 collection.index(['orderId','quantity']) 与 foreignKey 的示例，但未提示 foreignKey() 的返回值仍是 CollectionDefinitionBuilder、索引需要单独调用；链式写法容易把 { name } 误当 fields。",
        "suggestedChange": "在 .agents/skills/nocobase-db/SKILL.md 的 Builder 小节补一句：约束方法返回集合构建器而非字段构建器，命名索引须写 collection.index(fields, { name })，不可链式传选项对象。",
        "mechanizable": false
      }
    ],
    "note": "实现者自述，未经独立核验；不是框架评审结论。"
  },
